calm: rows 900 share 0.000000 pass true; rows-1-to-899 share 0.000000; rows-900-to-1799 share 0.000000
busy-top: rows 900 share 0.058988 pass false; rows-1-to-899 share 0.058988; rows-900-to-1799 share 0.000000
